      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-kafi:2:2:21:12",
      "text": [
        " قَالَ اللَّهُ عَزَّ وَ جَلَّ يَا ابْنَ آدَمَ اذْكُرْنِي فِي مَلَإٍ أَذْكُرْكَ فِي مَلَإٍ خَيْرٍ مِنْ مَلَئِكَ ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.hubeali": [
          "From him, from Ibn Fazzal, from Ghalib Bin Usman, from Bashir Al Dahhan, ",
          "(It has been narrated) from Abu Abdullah<sup>asws</sup> having said: ‘Allah<sup>azwj</sup> Mighty and Majestic Said: “O son of Adam<sup>as</sup>! Mention Me<sup>azwj</sup> in a gathering, I<sup>azwj</sup> shall Mention you in a gathering better than your gathering’."
        ],
        "en.sarwar": [
          "12. It is narrated from him (narrator of the Hadith above) from ibn Faddal from Ghalib ibn ‘Uthman from Bashir al-Dahhan from abu ‘Abd Allah (a.s.) who has said the following: “Allah, the Most Majestic, the Most Holy, has said, ‘O sons of Adam, speak of Me in public, I will speak of you in a public that is better than your public.’” "
        ]
      }
    },
